<section class="ref-group"><h2>Battles <span class="n">89</span></h2><ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-jabani"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-jabani.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Jabani</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1500</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Jabani was fought in 1500 in Shirvan, in present-day Azerbaijan, between the young Safavid leader Ismail and the Shirvanshah Farrukh Yasar.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-vedrosha"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-vedrosha.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Vedrosha</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1500</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Vedrosha was fought on 14 July 1500 on the Vedrosha River near Dorogobuzh in western Russia.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-sharur"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Sharur</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1501</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Sharur was fought in 1501 in the southern Caucasus, where Ismail, head of the Safaviyya order, led the Qizilbash to victory over the Aq Qoyunlu…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-lake-smolino"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Lake Smolino</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1502</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Lake Smolino was fought on 13 September 1502 near Pskov, when the Livonian Order under Master Wolter von Plettenberg defeated a much larger Muscovite army.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-cerignola"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-cerignola.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Cerignola</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 28 April 1503</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Cerignola was fought on 28 April 1503 in Apulia, southern Italy.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-garigliano-1503"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-the-garigliano-1503.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of the Garigliano (1503)</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1503</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of the Garigliano was fought on 29 December 1503 on the river Garigliano between Lazio and Campania, during the Italian Wars.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-knockdoe"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Knockdoe</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1504</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Knockdoe was fought on 19 August 1504 near Lackagh in County Galway, Ireland.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-agnadello"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-agnadello.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Agnadello</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1509</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Agnadello was fought on 14 May 1509 in Lombardy, when the French army of Louis XII routed the Venetian army.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-diu-1509"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Diu (1509)</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1509</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Diu was a naval battle fought in 1509 off Diu on the west coast of India.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-flodden"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/battle-of-flodden.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Flodden</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1513</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Flodden was fought on 9 Sep